{"id":"ag1-001","side":"defensive","category":"def_alert_triage","type":"boolean","state":"EDR records winword.exe spawning powershell.exe with a base64 -enc command that downloads a second-stage payload from a pastebin URL. The host is a finance user workstation. No change ticket or macro-signing policy explains it.","question":"Is this alert a true positive worth investigating?","criteria":{"true":"The behavior is a known malicious execution chain (office app spawning encoded PowerShell to fetch a payload) and needs investigation.","false":"The behavior is benign, expected, or explained by documented automation."},"target":true}
